From 7aa0fa7b4f7eef7d0299b648af59ca048364213e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tom Care <tcare@meta.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Oct 2025 11:33:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] Downgrade clang for Mac builds to work around libc++
 ios allocation crashes

Summary:
We were seeing build failures during the cvd host tool build on Mac, where `aprotoc` was segfaulting in the dyld std::ios initialization hook. This was using the static libc++, and working around that by switching to the regular dynamic libc++ would result in the grpc plugin having allocation issues in std::ios library code.

The allocations were done by the prebuilt distributed libc++, but being freed by libc++.1.dylib (the built in system library.) This happened for both RBE and local builds.

There were no obvious code bugs, and no fixes from upstream in this area. The stacks were quite deep in libc++, and often indirect (called by other library functions that used std::ios as an implementation detail.) I suspected a libc++abi bug, but there were no obvious issues in how things were linked.

Suspecting a compiler/toolchain issue, I switched down to the previous clang version and that fixed everything. We may want to roll the clang version to a newer one from upstream, but for now this is a straight forward fix that shouldn't affect too much for the Mac build.

We can isolate this to Darwin only.

Test Plan:
m casimir_control_server (minimal repro)

m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz
---
 cc/config/global.go | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/cc/config/global.go b/cc/config/global.go
index 5c7416cf8..8d015b246 100644
--- a/cc/config/global.go
+++ b/cc/config/global.go
@@ -463,7 +463,13 @@ var (
 
 	// prebuilts/clang default settings.
 	ClangDefaultBase         = "prebuilts/clang/host"
-	ClangDefaultVersion      = "clang-r547379"
+	ClangDefaultVersion = func() string {
+		// Workaound for libc++ ios issue on MacOS SDK 26
+		if runtime.GOOS == "darwin" {
+			return "clang-r536225"
+		}
+		return "clang-r547379"
+	}()
 	ClangDefaultShortVersion = "20"
 
 	// Directories with warnings from Android.bp files.
